{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfbqbMWLCttSLHmWT2QA8", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]` replaces a branch's base. It takes the commits that are in `<branch>` but not in `<upstream>` and replays them on top of `<newbase>`. A plain `git rebase` can only move commits onto the upstream you're comparing against. `--onto` lets you name the new base separately from the cut-off point.\n\n**Example:** you branched `feature` off `topic`, which was itself branched off `main`:\n\n```\nmain:     A---B---C\n                   \\\ntopic:              D---E\n                         \\\nfeature:                  F---G\n```\n\nYou want `feature` to sit directly on `main` and leave out `topic`'s commits (`D` and `E`):\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto main topic feature\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nmain:     A---B---C\n                   |\\\n                   | D---E            (topic, unchanged)\n                   \\\nfeature:            F'---G'\n```\n\nRead the command as: take the commits after `topic` up to `feature` (`F`, `G`) and replay them onto `main`. `F'` and `G'` are new commits with new hashes.\n\n**Common uses:**\n- **Transplant a branch**, as above, off another feature branch.\n- **Drop a range of commits.** `git rebase --onto A B` removes the commits between `A` and `B`. For example, `git rebase --onto HEAD~3 HEAD~1` drops the two commits just before `HEAD~1`.\n- **Recover after the upstream was squash-merged.** `git rebase --onto main <old-topic-tip> feature` moves only your own commits onto the updated `main`.\n\nBecause it rewrites history, avoid using it on branches others have already pulled. If you need to push the result, use `git push --force-with-lease`."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7212, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16780, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7212}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "f69674cc-7b61-425a-83bc-6f779de992c5", "uuid": "cebeb153-1a7e-456f-941f-c2f6f3a87d0c", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:32:55.243Z", "request_id": "req_011CfbqbM9W3Ve3rQocbcgGp"}
